;(Talk to Patient)
:'''Angry Patient:''' Do you have any idea how many years I've waited just to see the Healer Lady? And now someone cuts in line? How is that fair?
:'''Resigned Medic:''' Please calm down... That person is an esteemed guest who has traveled from afar. She simply couldn't wait in line for years, so we had to let her see the Healer Lady before you.
:'''Resigned Medic:''' But don't worry. As soon as she's done, it'll be your turn. By the way, the esteemed guest said she'll cover your medical expenses as compensation.
:'''Angry Patient:''' Well... I guess that's acceptable. Your "esteemed guest" seems reasonable, so I'll just pretend nothing happened.
:'''Resigned Medic:''' Thanks for understanding. Please have a rest over here.

